# README media: LOST LINKS. The GIF is the demo player's own game (real
# button presses) from where Dimple wakes; the stills are set up with the
# route cheat (the save as the demo player has it after N waypoints) and
# then played by the demo player.
shotscale 2
seed 18
game lostlinks
wait 60
press A
botuntil state == 2 400
gifstart lostlinks 3 2
botplay 900
gifstop
# up on the links: South Links, a swing being charged
cheat route 4
cheat ball 0 90 50
cheat aim 44
wait 40
hold A 30
shot lostlinks_links
hold B 1
# under them: Underputt, on the way to an iron
cheat route 6
botplay 300
shot lostlinks_caves
# the dunes and Gimme Manor, before the Dune Tread: chip, chip, chip
cheat route 36
cheat ball 0 127 58
cheat aim 50
wait 40
hold A 18
shot lostlinks_dunes
hold B 1
# the Brass Badger
cheat route 66
cheat plates 15
cheat ball 1 16 9
botuntil badger == 3 2000
wait 30
shot lostlinks_badger
# the whole world (spoilers)
cheat mapview 0
shot lostlinks_map_links
cheat mapview 1
shot lostlinks_map_under
cheat mapview -1
